  "body": "This release adds experimental difftastic support to the TUI, and makes a 💥 breaking change to TUI config. Please use the command `delta --tui --migrate-old-config` if you're affected by the latter.\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* fix: separate \"(binary file)\" suffix from filename in hyperlinks by @abobov in https://github.com/dandavison/delta/pull/2075\r\n* difftastic TUI integration by @dandavison in https://github.com/dandavison/delta/pull/2353\r\n* 💥 tui config by @dandavison in https://github.com/dandavison/delta/pull/2360\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @abobov made their first contribution in https://github.com/dandavison/delta/pull/2075\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/dandavison/delta/compare/0.21.2...0.22.0",
